		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1101_swrival_03_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……オマエら
ダークトリニティは　どこだ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T13:42:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……オマエら
ダークトリニティは　どこだ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T13:42:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：３回目
・swrival_03_01表示後
　振り向かずにメッセージ表示
・d27r0601での
　msg_d27r0101_swrival_03_01表示で削除</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:04:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
