	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1101_swplazmam1_03_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こいつ！　プラズマだんの
イッシュせいふくを　じゃまするな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>こいつ！　プラズマ団の
イッシュ征服を　じゃまするな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：３回目
・GRIDX＝27、GRIDZ＝34
　ライバルと戦闘中という設定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1101_swplazmam2_03_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もう　ポケモン　よこせよ！
おまえらに　かちめなんて　ないッ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>もう　ポケモン　よこせよ！
おまえらに　勝ち目なんて　ないッ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：３回目
・GRIDX＝28、GRIDZ＝33
　ライバルと戦闘中という設定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ２</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1101_swplazmam3_03_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あがけ　あがけ！▼
レシラムの　ひばしら
ゼクロムの　いなずま　よりも▽
キュレムの　こおりが　うえだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あがけ　あがけ！▼
レシラムの　火柱
ゼクロムの　稲妻　よりも▽
キュレムの　氷塊が　上だ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：３回目
・GRIDX＝26、GRIDZ＝29
　すでにライバルに負けたという設定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ３</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1101_swplazmam4_03_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>イッシュの　すべてが！
キュレムの　こおりで！▼
……ヴィオさま　だいじょうぶかな
あんなに　さむがり　なのに</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>イッシュの　すべてが！
キュレムの　氷で！▼
……ヴィオさま　大丈夫かな
あんなに　寒がり　なのに</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：３回目
・GRIDX＝28、GRIDZ＝31
　すでにライバルに負けたという設定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ４</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T08:03:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
